{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And from Mattanah to Nahaliel</b> — read as <b>מבמות הגיא</b> (from Bamoth of the valley). <span style=\"font-size: smaller;\">[The letter sequence is read as] <b>בא מות בגי</b> (death came in the valley), for it is written: <b>ויקבר אותו בגיא</b> (and He buried him in the valley) [Deuteronomy 34:6].</span>"], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {0 "The Aramaic-style spelling קרי (read) introduces a notarikon-style reading of מבמות הגיא as בא מות בגי, linking to Moses' burial in the valley per Deut. 34:6."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:45.232753332Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}